msgid "- Trend Dashboard: Is your configuration getting healthier or messier?  Every configuration you load is kept (see Changes Since...); this measures each one -- how long the longest Task is and how many are over 100 actions, how deeply If and For blocks nest, how many Perform Tasks deep the longest chain of calls goes, and what the Health Check finds -- and shows each number over time with a sparkline, for the whole configuration or for one Project.  It says 'healthier' when something fell and nothing rose, 'messier' when something rose and nothing fell, and 'about the same' otherwise; size is shown but never judged.  Each configuration is measured once and the figures are kept, so only the first look is slow.  The check for plugins missing from your device is left out, as it asks the device and not the backup.  From the command line, -trend [-file backup.xml] [-project NAME] prints the same report and exits with 10 when the newest backup is messier than the one before.  \n"
msgstr "- 趨勢看板：您的設定是否越來越健康或越來越混亂？ 您載入的每一個設定都會被保留（請參閱...自上次更新以來），它會測量每一個設定：包括最長任務的時間、超過 100 個動作的數量、`If` 和 `For` 區塊的嵌套深度、最長呼叫鏈的深度、以及健康檢查的結果，並以時間序列圖的形式顯示，無論是整個設定，還是單一專案。 當某個設定變差，但沒有其他設定變好時，顯示「越來越健康」；當某個設定變好，但沒有其他設定變差時，顯示「越來越混亂」；其他情況則顯示「差不多」；設定的大小會顯示，但不會進行評估。 每個設定只會被測量一次，並保留數據，因此第一次查看時會比較慢。 檢查您裝置是否有遺失的插件，則會被省略，因為它會詢問裝置，而不是備份。 從命令列，`-trend [-file backup.xml] [-project NAME]` 顯示相同報告，並在最新備份比前一個備份更差時，結束程式並顯示 10。\n"
